
Talent Protocol is a Web3 platform focused on helping individuals build professional reputations and access career opportunities. Speedrun Ethereum complements Talent Protocol by:

Providing proof-of-work: Completed challenges serve as public, verifiable proof of a developer’s skills.
Building portfolios: Developers can showcase their Speedrun builds on Talent Protocol profiles.
Creating opportunities: Talent scouts and DAOs can discover skilled builders based on their Speedrun Ethereum activity.

Together, these platforms empower developers to learn, build, and get hired — all onchain
